    "objective": "mean next-token cross-entropy + 0.02 x HF Mixtral router load-balancing loss per forward pass",
    "numerics": "FP32 master weights and Adam moments; BF16 projections, attention and expert matrix products; FP32 cross-entropy",
    "optimizer": "AdamW beta1 0.9, eps 1e-6, global clip 1.0, decoupled decay on matrices; beta2 = 0.999^(B/128); weight decay matched per token",
